OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud thickening with patchy
OL,6,Frain and freshening winds during the
OL,7,Fmorning, the rain turning heavy at
OL,8,Ftimes in the afternoon. The south or
OL,9,Fsoutheast winds becoming strong.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FTurning showery during the
OL,12,Fevening as wind turn into the
OL,13,Fsouthwest. The showers becoming well
OL,14,Fscattered overnight with occasional
OL,15,Fclear spells.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FIt will be bright with sunny
OL,18,Fspells and a scattering of showers,
OL,19,Fthe showers dying out during the
OL,20,Fafternoon. Moderate or fresh
OL,21,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
